# Console Pi - TAT tiet kiem dien tren card WiFi
#
# VI SAO: mac dinh Raspberry Pi bat power_save cho wlan0. Card WiFi ngu bot de
# tiet kiem dien, nhung hau qua la:
#   - Router mat lien lac voi Pi sau mot luc khong co traffic
#   - Console/SSH/ping deu khong toi duoc
#   - NHUNG IP van con tren interface -> man hinh Pi van hien IP nhu binh thuong
#     khien nguoi dung tuong mang van tot
#
# Day la nguyen nhan kinh dien gay "dang dung tu nhien rot WiFi" tren Pi.
# Voi thiet bi console dung luc su co mang, khong duoc phep de xay ra.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="net", KERNEL=="wlan*", \
    RUN+="/usr/sbin/iw dev %k set power_save off"
